{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "doc": "The shared contract for ctxdiff's cross-SDK golden corpus. BOTH SDKs read this file: the Python harness (spec/golden/harness.py, driven by tests/test_golden.py) and the JS harness (js/test/helpers/golden.ts, driven by js/test/golden.test.ts). Each SDK rebuilds every fixture from spec/golden/corpus/*.json with ITS OWN tokenizer, hasher and labeler, renders the cases below with ITS OWN CLI and viewer, and compares against the committed expectations in spec/golden/expected/. A drift in either SDK fails; a drift in both still fails until `python spec/golden/regenerate.py` is run deliberately and the diff is reviewed.",

  "tz": "UTC",
  "no_color": true,

  "ctxdiff_version": "0.0.0-golden",
  "ctxdiff_version_note": "The `ctxdiff_version` written into every golden run row is PINNED to this literal rather than taken from each SDK's own version constant. The two packages version independently (PyPI `ctxdiff` and npm `ctxdiff` are separate release trains), and that field is embedded verbatim in the HTML payload — so without this pin the HTML hash could never be shared between the SDKs and the strongest half of the check would be lost. The field itself is covered by tests/test_store.py and js/test/store.test.ts; nothing else in the golden depends on it.",

  "tokenizers": {
    "python": {
      "package": "tiktoken",
      "pinned_version": "0.13.0",
      "encoding": "o200k_base"
    },
    "javascript": {
      "package": "gpt-tokenizer",
      "pinned_version": "3.4.0",
      "encoding": "o200k_base"
    },
    "note": "Both are pinned to an EXACT version (pyproject.toml / js/package.json). These two libraries are independent reimplementations of the same BPE encoding on independent release cadences, so a floating bump on either side could change a rendered token number without a single line of ctxdiff changing. Re-pinning is a deliberate act: bump the pin, run `python spec/golden/regenerate.py`, and review the resulting diff — a non-empty diff is the tokenizer changing its mind, and must be understood before merging."
  },

  "fixtures": [
    {"id": "special-tokens", "corpus": "corpus/special-tokens.json", "ctrace": "special-tokens.ctrace"},
    {"id": "unicode", "corpus": "corpus/unicode.json", "ctrace": "unicode.ctrace"},
    {"id": "code-and-schemas", "corpus": "corpus/code-and-schemas.json", "ctrace": "code-and-schemas.ctrace"},
    {"id": "multiagent-project", "corpus": "corpus/multiagent-project.json", "ctrace": "multiagent-project.ctrace"},
